ffplay: Phoenix-RTOS M10 measurement knobs (opt-in, environment)

FFPLAY_STATLINE_MS=<ms> prints a newline-terminated "ffplay-stat" line every <ms> with a
count of the frames shown (ffplay's own \r status line has no fps and cannot be split in a
serial console log); FFPLAY_AUTOKEYS="<s>:<key>,..." pushes key presses (pause fs left right
up down step quit) through ffplay's normal event loop at fixed wall-clock times, so an
unattended Pi cycle exercises the same controls a keyboard does. Both are off unless set.

LGPL-2.1-or-later, as fftools/ffplay.c.

